%I A398339 #17 Aug 30 2026 23:58:26
%S A398339 8,43,65792,15251194969974
%N A398339 Numbers of the form x^^y + y^^x, where x and y are integers greater than 1 and ^^ denotes tetration.
%C A398339 Subsequence of A397766.
%C A398339 The rapid growth of tetration is why a(5) = 2^^5 + 5^^2 already has 19729 digits.
%C A398339 a(2) = 43 is the only known prime in this sequence, and it is unknown whether another prime term exists.
%e A398339 a(2) = 2^^3 + 3^^2.
%Y A398339 Cf. A275211, A397766, A393643.
